---
id: UC-AD-AuditLog-Lihat
title: Activity Diagram - Audit Log (Lihat)
---
flowchart LR
  start((Mulai)) --> A1

  subgraph Admin
    A1[Buka menu Audit Log]
    A2[Pilih filter periode/user/aksi]
    A3[Klik Terapkan Filter]
  end

  subgraph Sistem
    S1[Tampilkan halaman audit log]
    S2[Ambil data log sesuai filter]
    S3[Tampilkan daftar log]
    S4{Admin buka detail log?}
    S5[Tampilkan detail perubahan]
  end

  A1 --> S1 --> A2 --> A3 --> S2 --> S3 --> S4
  S4 -- Ya --> S5 --> endn((Selesai))
  S4 -- Tidak --> endn
